label: Transmission line
pluralLabel: Transmission lines
entityType: BASIC
physicalTableName: TRANSMISSIONLINE
iconUrl: images://mdi/transmission-tower.svg
description: |-
  Overhead line or cable connecting two substations, from the authoritative network model.

  AI agent instructions: A line is undirected electrically: From and To only record the modelling direction, so look at both sides when asking which lines connect a substation.
